      "refersTo": "bottom-nav",
      "description": "Пример локально в панели; в приложении фиксируется у нижнего края.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Основная навигация\"><button aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z\"/></svg><span>Сегодня</span></button><button><svg width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7L3 8\"/><path d=\"M3 3v5h5M12 7v5l4 2\"/></svg><span>История</span></button><button><svg width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"M20 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0\"/></svg><span>Профиль</span></button></nav>",
